---
// Wortmarke im Stil des Logos: Serifen-Versalien mit weitem Abstand, goldener Bogen darüber
---
<span class="logo" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="arc" viewBox="0 0 200 18" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M4 17 Q100 -6 196 17" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.4" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
  <span class="w">Domi’s on Tour</span>
</span>
<style>
  .logo { display: inline-flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; line-height: 1; }
  .arc { width: 86%; height: 8px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .w { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.98rem; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: -0.26em; }
</style>
